              "start": 28
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The Court held that Indian country within a State\u2019s territory is part of the State, so State jurisdiction exists unless preempted."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "4a468821a41d0eb3d2992bd74e63cf74d84201c490b761c9418b5cac9f190b20",
