              "start": 20
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The Court concluded that the General Crimes Act does not preempt State jurisdiction over crimes by non\u2011Indians against Indians in Indian country."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Gorsuch",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "4a468821a41d0eb3d2992bd74e63cf74d84201c490b761c9418b5cac9f190b20",
